    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-clip/releases/tag/v@VERSION@</releaseNotes>
    <tags>clipboard clipboard-manager sync encrypted cross-platform</tags>
    <summary>Clipboard manager that looks identical on Windows, macOS and Linux</summary>
    <description>
A clipboard manager that looks and behaves the same on Windows, macOS and Linux.
It is a single executable written entirely in Rust and draws its own UI with a
built-in CPU rasterizer - no Qt, WebView or Electron.

History is stored locally and encrypted by default. Sync between devices is
end-to-end encrypted and happens only with devices you have approved, either
directly over the local network or through a relay. No runtime dependencies.

License: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 - free for noncommercial use only;
commercial use is not permitted under this license.
    </description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
